<title>USA: National Pork Producers name Alan Tank new CEO.</title>
<headline>National Pork Producers name Alan Tank new CEO.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Board of Directors of the Naitional Pork Producers Council, NPPC, announced the appointment of Alan Tank as chief executive officer of the organization effective March 1.</p>
<p>Tank will succeed Larry Graham who had previously announced his resignation, NPPC said in a statement.</p>
<p>For over five years, 38-year old Tank has been NPPC's Vice President of Public Policy and Trade. In that position he has managed the organization's Washington, D.C. office and has been responsible for foreign market development efforts, NPPC said.</p>
<p>((Jerry Bieszk 312-408-8725))</p>
